<title>FRANCE: Eridania to retain control of Koipe.</title>
<headline>Eridania to retain control of Koipe.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franco-Italian food group Eridania Beghin-Say said on Thursday it was supporting opening the capital of Spanish oil group Koipe to the public but intended to retain a majority interest in the company.</p>
<p>&quot;We think the amount of capital in the hands of the public is too small. We are in favour of stepping up Koipe's presence on the stock market. But we do not want to loose our majority stake in Koipe. We will not cut our stake below 50 percent,&quot; Chairman Stefano Meloni told a news conference.</p>
<p>Koipe is listed on the Madrid stock exchange.</p>
<p>On Wednesday Eridania acquired from Spanish tobacco group Tabacalera a 9.66 percent interest in Koipe, increasing its stake in the company to 75.95 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
